Key":"416ab53b2f977ed0e3a36b2d2ea449cb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I want to add an extra event (cutting cake) for my special day. For this I am looking for a wedding cake and unable to find best wedding cake. Do you have any idea regarding this.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1825029,"PostDate":1389424114,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I want to add an extra event (cutting cake) for my special day. For this I am looking for a wedding cake and unable to find best wedding cake. Do you have any idea regarding this.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.a2zweddingcards.com\/christian-wedding-invitations'>latest Christian Wedding Invitation Cards<\/a> for my special wedding day!!","Email":"jsteyn416@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.36.29.67","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389249442,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275957.jpg?_r=1389249689","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mark21","Id":275957,"Name":"mark21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.97.137.247","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75949,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3e757530c5d8a2feb89fd4420c266a3c","RawContent":"I think the answer to your question depends a great deal on where you&#039;re getting married. Have you selected a resort? Some resorts have wedding packages that include a cake and you might even be able to upgrade it. So if your package includes a cake, time is allotted for your cake cutting \"ceremony\". My husband and I are renewing our vows next year and it will be just the two of us so I based my resort decision on on the inclusions. So far I&#039;m strongly leaning towards Couples Swept Away because it is an adults only and offers in my opinion a lot in the all inclusive pkg. I&#039;m even going to have a special song played (well a portion of it) as we cut our cake. So I say all of that to  say all of that to say your cake dilemma is most likely solved with your resort selection.\n\nHope that helps.","Attachments":[],"Id":1825164,"PostDate":1389491650,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I think the answer to your question depends a great deal on where you're getting married. Have you selected a resort? Some resorts have wedding packages that include a cake and you might even be able to upgrade it. So if your package includes a cake, time is allotted for your cake cutting \"ceremony\". My husband and I are renewing our vows next year and it will be just the two of us so I based my resort decision on on the inclusions. So far I'm strongly leaning towards Couples Swept Away because it is an adults only and offers in my opinion a lot in the all inclusive pkg. I'm even going to have a special song played (well a portion of it) as we cut our cake. So I say all of that to  say all of that to say your cake dilemma is most likely solved with your resort selection.<br>\nHope that helps.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"denisetravis324@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.97.137.247","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1376618632,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272639.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Nissi324","Id":272639,"Name":"Nissi324","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.36.29.67","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75949,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"04b0d4504f6a5cd4cb43de4e2cd143b8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;thanks a lot for your informations.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1825418,"PostDate":1389593999,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>thanks a lot for your informations.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.a2zweddingcards.com\/christian-wedding-invitations'>latest Christian Wedding Invitation Cards<\/a> for my special wedding day!!","Email":"jsteyn416@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.36.29.67","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389249442,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275957.jpg?_r=1389249689","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mark21","Id":275957,"Name":"mark21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"112.198.77.9","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75949,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"db3da84a0b529f0dc19ed7b4ee7ae4c8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wedding cake cutting is indeed a part of wedding ceremony for some people. It symbolizes the sharing of food between the couples and how they share their love to one another. You can order a personalized heart shaped cake to be used for the activity.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1833636,"PostDate":1392343555,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wedding cake cutting is indeed a part of wedding ceremony for some people. It symbolizes the sharing of food between the couples and how they share their love to one another. You can order a personalized heart shaped cake to be used for the activity.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gwengrinn@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"112.198.90.211","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391741828,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Geraldine","Id":276546,"Name":"Geraldine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.177.132.210","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75949,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab9f72b18fa37ae344a2c01d2acd92d5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We just ordered ours through the resort.&amp;nbsp; It wasn&#039;t anything fancy, but you bring a topper of some sort and you&#039;ll be happy enough&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1834532,"PostDate":1392781542,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We just ordered ours through the resort.\u00a0 It wasn't anything fancy, but you bring a topper of some sort and you'll be happy enough<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mvee1025@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.177.132.210","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359865300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265570.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mvee1025","Id":265570,"Name":"mvee1025","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"86.19.162.103","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75949,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by alisha85, 23 February 2014 - 06:24 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1393165487,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e03315608ac928a45b835a6aed4f6b3f","RawContent":"We have just got married at csa (17th February 2014). You do have two options where to marry, the beach where you are verrrry close to strangers in your pictures and you will be taken elsewhere to have your cake cut or the gardens where you have a private ceremony and will cut your cake their too. We had ours in the gardens after only deciding to make this change 2 hrs before the ceremony. \n\n\nBest decision ever. If you you any questions about the resort, wedding, photographer etc please get in touch","Attachments":[],"Id":1835218,"PostDate":1393165405,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We have just got married at csa (17th February 2014). You do have two options where to marry, the beach where you are verrrry close to strangers in your pictures and you will be taken elsewhere to have your cake cut or the gardens where you have a private ceremony and will cut your cake their too. We had ours in the gardens after only deciding to make this change 2 hrs before the ceremony. <br><br>\nBest decision ever. If you you any questions about the resort, wedding, photographer etc please get in touch\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alisha_crayton@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"86.19.162.103","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373981292,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271584.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"alisha85","Id":271584,"Name":"alisha85","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.173.33.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75949,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa48bae1e533640d3e252808e0759691","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey mark21,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats for starting your new life .&amp;nbsp; I married in December last year at Houston and it was my great wish to cut wedding cake on this special occasion. Whole arrangement was at House Plantation and we added this special function also. If you want to know more you can &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/houseplantation.com\/cakes-etc\/&#039;&gt;visit here.&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910544,"PostDate":1454661103,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey mark21,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats for starting your new life .\u00a0 I married in December last year at Houston and it was my great wish to cut wedding cake on this special occasion. Whole arrangement was at House Plantation and we added this special function also. If you want to know more you can <a href='http:\/\/houseplantation.com\/cakes-etc\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>visit here.<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"msginnie4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.173.33.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1454488020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"margretAA","Id":286119,"Name":"margretAA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"114.124.33.144","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75949,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a6495e06b563721f29c48bcd848004fe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;i just order from my friends&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910603,"PostDate":1454840772,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>i just order from my friends<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samwillow39@gmail.com","IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430664822,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282964.jpg?_r=1431149209","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samwillow","Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75949,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c6e6e7076de3b7d80753ffda2865c54","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"mark21\"]!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Right now there are many options for an oustanding wedding cake. Some brides choose a traditional style but other prefer a more creative and casual idea and we&#039;ve seen them all: from naked cakes to donut cakes, a symbolic cake on top of a bunch of cupcakes for all of the guests, or even just by adding some floral decor on top to bring more color to them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;In our tropical venue, we&#039;seen many styles from many brides and here are just a few pics:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:82700]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;*&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;We are a private beach wedding location at the south bay of Puerto Vallarta, Mexico. If you are looking for something unique and memorable, this is the place for you. For more information or a quote please contact us at: info@adventureweddingsvallarta.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910812,"PostDate":1455326151,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275957\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275957-mark21\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">mark21<\/span><\/a>!<\/p>\n<p>Right now there are many options for an oustanding wedding cake. Some brides choose a traditional style but other prefer a more creative and casual idea and we've seen them all: from naked cakes to donut cakes, a symbolic cake on top of a bunch of cupcakes for all of the guests, or even just by adding some floral decor on top to bring more color to them.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>In our tropical venue, we'seen many styles from many brides and here are just a few pics:<\/p>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/82700-creative-ideas-for-a-wedding-cake\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_212873.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Creative Ideas for a Wedding Cake'  width='200' height='200'  alt='Creative Ideas for a Wedding Cake' id='sml_image_view_82700' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>*<span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">We are a private beach wedding location at the south bay of Puerto Vallarta, Mexico. If you are looking for something unique and memorable, this is the place for you. For more information or a quote please contact us at: info@adventureweddingsvallarta.com<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343058803,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"75949","Title":"Wedding Cake?","LastPostDate":1455326151},"Pages":{"TotalItems":9,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
