rue,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24346,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ebd1e0ce6d177046eaf67bdd544d8e15","RawContent":"Thanks Bianca!","Attachments":[],"Id":643011,"PostDate":1238959840,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks Bianca!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tdtillman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1235711133,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":56,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tdmitchell","Id":215303,"Name":"tdmitchell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24346,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8944bb70ecbbef6e2a15246d26fc34c8","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;hanna&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I don&#039;t mean to be unethical, but is there any way to purchase from Flowers by Design wholesale prices. I won&#039;t be reselling them, but just wish I could obtain the wholesale prices. Does anyone have any ideas or suggestions? \n \n Each stem comes with 8+ orchids. Does anyone have an extra flower that you can mail me so I can see the quality before I place a huge order&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Unfortunately, you need a business number\/tax ID number for purchasing wholesale with them. \n \n There are also a few other vendors not mentioned in the original list...\n \n Shavon&#039;s Wedding Silks &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.shavonsweddingsilks.com\"&gt;fresh real natural touch artificial silk wedding bouquet flowers&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bittersweetweddingdesigns.com\"&gt;Bitter Sweet Wedding Designs&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n There&#039;s also Flowerstogo....but I can&#039;t figure out her link so I&#039;ll post it when I find it.","Attachments":[],"Id":643296,"PostDate":1238978328,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>hanna<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I don't mean to be unethical, but is there any way to purchase from Flowers by Design wholesale prices. I won't be reselling them, but just wish I could obtain the wholesale prices. Does anyone have any ideas or suggestions? <br \/> <br \/> Each stem comes with 8+ orchids. Does anyone have an extra flower that you can mail me so I can see the quality before I place a huge order<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Unfortunately, you need a business number\/tax ID number for purchasing wholesale with them. <br \/> <br \/> There are also a few other vendors not mentioned in the original list...<br \/> <br \/> Shavon's Wedding Silks <a href='http:\/\/www.shavonsweddingsilks.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>fresh real natural touch artificial silk wedding bouquet flowers<\/a><br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.bittersweetweddingdesigns.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Bitter Sweet Wedding Designs<\/a><br \/> <br \/> There's also Flowerstogo....but I can't figure out her link so I'll post it when I find it.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bswd@telus.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1222824540,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212059.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bittersweet","Id":212059,"Name":"bittersweet","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24346,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"42c7671fe2db06134e41a2ed06f3d425","RawContent":"I was just going to add you Crystal! You beat me to it! \n \n Ladies, I completely recommend &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bettersweetweddingdesigns.com\"&gt;www.bettersweetweddingdesigns.com&lt;\/a&gt; Crystal gives great service, quick shipping and my flowers are beautiful! Thanks Crystal!","Attachments":[],"Id":643335,"PostDate":1238981825,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I was just going to add you Crystal! You beat me to it! <br \/> <br \/> Ladies, I completely recommend <a href='http:\/\/www.bettersweetweddingdesigns.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.bettersweetweddingdesigns.com<\/a> Crystal gives great service, quick shipping and my flowers are beautiful! Thanks Crystal!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/558\/562\/20090415\/Our+Jamaican+Wedding\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/558\/5...ing\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ganaime@nstu.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1221524283,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211745.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"montegobay09","Id":211745,"Name":"montegobay09","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":41,"TotalPages":5,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":40},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{