le behind. I have not selected a package yet. I paid the deposit to hold the date and location. When you selected your package did you pay upfront or have to add an additional deposit ?<br><br><br><br>\nLaura is my contact also\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Stewarjs2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.102.197.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385329037,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275292.jpg?_r=1387054671","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bigleap35","Id":275292,"Name":"Bigleap35","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1389833067,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c68439b5c437c9ab9314bec34f58fb40","RawContent":"I believe you just pay the deposit. If I&#039;m not mistaken after you pick a package they will send you a contract to sign. You maybe able to split the cost. Pay half and half.\nI&#039;m waiting to finalize all of that myself this week.","Attachments":[],"Id":1826431,"PostDate":1389833088,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I believe you just pay the deposit. If I'm not mistaken after you pick a package they will send you a contract to sign. You maybe able to split the cost. Pay half and half.<br \/>I'm waiting to finalize al