{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"158.82.202.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"59118742e6ae777b7f4005d6f948a120","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"rbehlke\"] I got my dress from &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.ferresposa.com&#039;&gt;Ferre Sposa&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;(at Bloor and Ossington) and I can&#039;t recommend them enough. My sister got her wedding dress there after a disaster at another location and they were amazing, so I knew I needed to get my dress there too.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The dressing areas are much more private than others I&#039;ve seen and the people that work there are so helpful and friendly. They don&#039;t shove you out the door at the 1 hr mark of your appointment and never make you feel pressured into buying anything. Their dresses are much more reasonably priced than a lot of other places too.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My dress is lighter than most of the others that I tried on, but it&#039;s still not super beachy. I think a big part of the decision on type of dress is the location of your wedding reception - if indoors with A\/C then you can get away with a heavier dress for sure. Some girls buy a second (usually shorter) dress to wear during the reception to stay cool, others just grin and bear it in the heat. I&#039;m in the grin and bear it crowd, based on the cost of the dress and how much I love it. I want to wear it all night even if I sweat to death!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is my dress:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80726]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?style=4MC844&#039;&gt;This&lt;\/a&gt; is the dress on the model since the lighting in my pic is terrible.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Happy dress shopping - it was so much more fun than I thought it was going to be!&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893724,"PostDate":1429550985,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279694\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279694-rbehlke\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">rbehlke<\/span><\/a> I got my dress from <a href='http:\/\/www.ferresposa.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Ferre Sposa<\/a>\u00a0(at Bloor and Ossington) and I can't recommend them enough. My sister got her wedding dress there after a disaster at another location and they were amazing, so I knew I needed to get my dress there too.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The dressing areas are much more private than others I've seen and the people that work there are so helpful and friendly. They don't shove you out the door at the 1 hr mark of your appointment and never make you feel pressured into buying anything. Their dresses are much more reasonably priced than a lot of other places too.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My dress is lighter than most of the others that I tried on, but it's still not super beachy. I think a big part of the decision on type of dress is the location of your wedding reception - if indoors with A\/C then you can get away with a heavier dress for sure. Some girls buy a second (usually shorter) dress to wear during the reception to stay cool, others just grin and bear it in the heat. I'm in the grin and bear it crowd, based on the cost of the dress and how much I love it. I want to wear it all night even if I sweat to death!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is my dress:\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80726-the-dress\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17998\/sml_gallery_281820_17998_203563.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='The Dress'  width='158' height='200'  alt='The Dress' id='sml_image_view_80726' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a href='http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?style=4MC844' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>This<\/a> is the dress on the model since the lighting in my pic is terrible.\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Happy dress shopping - it was so much more fun than I thought it was going to be!<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;6\/st\/20160409\/e\/our+Wedding+Day\/k\/a16a\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n","Email":"krystalball@gmail.com","IpAddress":"158.82.202.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1421864163,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281820.jpg?_r=1440261411","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"krystalball","Id":281820,"Name":"krystalball","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.71.15.12","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1daa11e487ded591ca52c12719b51a3f","RawContent":"Yay for 2016 brides ! We&#039;re booked for Jan.19\/2016 barcelo tropical resort.  \n\n@[member=\"krystalball\"] love your dress!! I just bought mine this past Saturday! Mine is similar to yours with the lace but with straps and some jewels. So exciting!\n\nWe have 36 guests already booked for our wedding can&#039;t believe it , have just sent out homemade stds so far!","Attachments":[],"Id":1893770,"PostDate":1429583978,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yay for 2016 brides ! We're booked for Jan.19\/2016 barcelo tropical resort.  <br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281820\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281820-krystalball\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">krystalball<\/span><\/a> love your dress!! I just bought mine this past Saturday! Mine is similar to yours with the lace but with straps and some jewels. So exciting!<br>\nWe have 36 guests already booked for our wedding can't believe it , have just sent out homemade stds so far!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#cc6666;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"><em>Forever can never be long enough for me, to feel like I've had long enough with you...19\/01\/2016<\/em><\/span><\/span>","Email":"kimberlydiana@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.76.172.36","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412304687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280238.png?_r=1412619945","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":60,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kimmyd2","Id":280238,"Name":"kimmyd2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f7ce94486fcd3b12f2bd212bbf4aa2ec","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kimmyd2\" post=\"1893770\" timestamp=\"1429583978\"]\nYay for 2016 brides ! We&#039;re booked for Jan.19\/2016 barcelo tropical resort.\n@[member=\"krystalball\"] love your dress!! I just bought mine this past Saturday! Mine is similar to yours with the lace but with straps and some jewels. So exciting!\nWe have 36 guests already booked for our wedding can&#039;t believe it , have just sent out homemade stds so far![\/quote]\nAwe I love your quote.  My bridal party watched down the isle to this song :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1893797,"PostDate":1429622946,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kimmyd2, on 20 April 2015 - 06:39 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Yay for 2016 brides ! We're booked for Jan.19\/2016 barcelo tropical resort.<br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281820\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281820-krystalball\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">krystalball<\/span><\/a> love your dress!! I just bought mine this past Saturday! Mine is similar to yours with the lace but with straps and some jewels. So exciting!<br>\nWe have 36 guests already booked for our wedding can't believe it , have just sent out homemade stds so far!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Awe I love your quote. \u00a0My bridal party watched down the isle to this song <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.140.181.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7c823589faceb0e1998295f0aaca3ad0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"GlenRosa90\" post=\"1891907\" timestamp=\"1428271957\"]\nHi girls! We have confirmed July 9th 2016 at Gran Caribe Real Canc\u00fan. \nI&#039;m so nervous and I keep telling myself we still have over a year to plan! Yet, I want to start everything!!!\nWhen are you planning to send your stds? Since half of the family is traveling, I was thinking about sending them with one year anticipation. \nHappy planning![\/quote]How exciting! Congrats! We just had our wedding at Gran Caribe Real. Highly recommended! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1893799,"PostDate":1429623929,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>GlenRosa90, on 05 April 2015 - 02:12 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi girls! We have confirmed July 9th 2016 at Gran Caribe Real Canc\u00fan. <br>\nI'm so nervous and I keep telling myself we still have over a year to plan! Yet, I want to start everything!!!<br>\nWhen are you planning to send your stds? Since half of the family is traveling, I was thinking about sending them with one year anticipation. <br>\nHappy planning!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nHow exciting! Congrats! We just had our wedding at Gran Caribe Real. Highly recommended! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong>N&C<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em>April 17, 2015<\/em><\/p>\n<p>Gran Caribe Real (Cancun, Mexico)<\/p>\n<p>Including Bride & Groom: 22 guests (19 adults & 3 children)","Email":"nancysoup@att.net","IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411661062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hellosassypants","Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"128.100.41.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f9f0c1323e2f5a4a6f22177322eb6eda","RawContent":"[quote name=\"krystalball\" post=\"1893724\" timestamp=\"1429550985\"]\n\n@[member=\"rbehlke\"] I got my dress from [url=\"http:\/\/www.ferresposa.com\"]Ferre Sposa[\/url] (at Bloor and Ossington) and I can&#039;t recommend them enough. My sister got her wedding dress there after a disaster at another location and they were amazing, so I knew I needed to get my dress there too.\n\nThe dressing areas are much more private than others I&#039;ve seen and the people that work there are so helpful and friendly. They don&#039;t shove you out the door at the 1 hr mark of your appointment and never make you feel pressured into buying anything. Their dresses are much more reasonably priced than a lot of other places too. \n\nMy dress is lighter than most of the others that I tried on, but it&#039;s still not super beachy. I think a big part of the decision on type of dress is the location of your wedding reception - if indoors with A\/C then you can get away with a heavier dress for sure. Some girls buy a second (usually shorter) dress to wear during the reception to stay cool, others just grin and bear it in the heat. I&#039;m in the grin and bear it crowd, based on the cost of the dress and how much I love it. I want to wear it all night even if I sweat to death!\n\nThis is my dress: \n\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?style=4MC844\"]This[\/url] is the dress on the model since the lighting in my pic is terrible. \n\nHappy dress shopping - it was so much more fun than I thought it was going to be!\n[\/quote]What a gorgeous dress! Thank you so much for the store recommendation. I can&#039;t wait to begin the dress shopping!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1894609,"PostDate":1430166851,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>krystalball, on 20 April 2015 - 09:29 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279694\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279694-rbehlke\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">rbehlke<\/span><\/a> I got my dress from <a href='http:\/\/www.ferresposa.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Ferre Sposa<\/a>\u00a0(at Bloor and Ossington) and I can't recommend them enough. My sister got her wedding dress there after a disaster at another location and they were amazing, so I knew I needed to get my dress there too.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The dressing areas are much more private than others I've seen and the people that work there are so helpful and friendly. They don't shove you out the door at the 1 hr mark of your appointment and never make you feel pressured into buying anything. Their dresses are much more reasonably priced than a lot of other places too.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My dress is lighter than most of the others that I tried on, but it's still not super beachy. I think a big part of the decision on type of dress is the location of your wedding reception - if indoors with A\/C then you can get away with a heavier dress for sure. Some girls buy a second (usually shorter) dress to wear during the reception to stay cool, others just grin and bear it in the heat. I'm in the grin and bear it crowd, based on the cost of the dress and how much I love it. I want to wear it all night even if I sweat to death!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is my dress:\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a href='http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?style=4MC844' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>This<\/a> is the dress on the model since the lighting in my pic is terrible.\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Happy dress shopping - it was so much more fun than I thought it was going to be!<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>What a gorgeous dress! Thank you so much for the store recommendation. I can't wait to begin the dress shopping!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"robynb7@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.233.112.15","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1409889393,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279694.jpg?_r=1425843817","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":171,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rbehlke","Id":279694,"Name":"rbehlke","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"167.57.13.14","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"689f45d7b8edbad86a7cc6a60023f084","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi girls! I love reading all your comments, they make me feel like im super behind on my planning. At this moment I&#039;m actually freaking out because it seems like we are moving our date forward from July 9th to Jan 23rd&amp;nbsp; :o. The thing is I&#039;m a teacher and I get december, january, and february off, and on june, I only get 2 weeks off. So, thinking about packing and getting ready, and the bridezilla I&#039;ll likely be, we are now checking availability for January. Which would mean I have to have everything ready NOW (I might be overreacting...) any words of advice??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Are any of you having a agency doing the bookings? I just want to lean all the responsibility of tickets and hotels to one person!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894770,"PostDate":1430261721,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi girls! I love reading all your comments, they make me feel like im super behind on my planning. At this moment I'm actually freaking out because it seems like we are moving our date forward from July 9th to Jan 23rd\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>. The thing is I'm a teacher and I get december, january, and february off, and on june, I only get 2 weeks off. So, thinking about packing and getting ready, and the bridezilla I'll likely be, we are now checking availability for January. Which would mean I have to have everything ready NOW (I might be overreacting...) any words of advice??<\/p>\n<p>Are any of you having a agency doing the bookings? I just want to lean all the responsibility of tickets and hotels to one person!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"glenrosado@gmail.com","IpAddress":"152.156.246.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423176435,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282015.jpg?_r=1428272293","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":170,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GlenRosa90","Id":282015,"Name":"GlenRosa90","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f0d165921d09670a3042951e7c2c72e6","RawContent":"[quote name=\"GlenRosa90\" post=\"1894770\" timestamp=\"1430261721\"]\nHi girls! I love reading all your comments, they make me feel like im super behind on my planning. At this moment I&#039;m actually freaking out because it seems like we are moving our date forward from July 9th to Jan 23rd  :o. The thing is I&#039;m a teacher and I get december, january, and february off, and on june, I only get 2 weeks off. So, thinking about packing and getting ready, and the bridezilla I&#039;ll likely be, we are now checking availability for January. Which would mean I have to have everything ready NOW (I might be overreacting...) any words of advice??\nAre any of you having a agency doing the bookings? I just want to lean all the responsibility of tickets and hotels to one person![\/quote]Don&#039;t fret! I got married January 21 and at this time last year we hadn&#039;t even booked our resort yet :) we booked early may and had invites out mid may.   I had tonnes of time! Just do small things at a time.  \n\nI used a travel agency ... There can be group booking discounts and other special offers for bride and groom.  I&#039;m on my phone so unsure where you live. If in the USA the owner of this site is an agent and would be perfect. If in Canada I can recommend mine :)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1894777,"PostDate":1430265238,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>GlenRosa90, on 28 April 2015 - 02:55 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi girls! I love reading all your comments, they make me feel like im super behind on my planning. At this moment I'm actually freaking out because it seems like we are moving our date forward from July 9th to Jan 23rd  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>. The thing is I'm a teacher and I get december, january, and february off, and on june, I only get 2 weeks off. So, thinking about packing and getting ready, and the bridezilla I'll likely be, we are now checking availability for January. Which would mean I have to have everything ready NOW (I might be overreacting...) any words of advice??<br>\nAre any of you having a agency doing the bookings? I just want to lean all the responsibility of tickets and hotels to one person!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nDon't fret! I got married January 21 and at this time last year we hadn't even booked our resort yet <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> we booked early may and had invites out mid may.   I had tonnes of time! Just do small things at a time.  <br><br>\nI used a travel agency ... There can be group booking discounts and other special offers for bride and groom.  I'm on my phone so unsure where you live. If in the USA the owner of this site is an agent and would be perfect. If in Canada I can recommend mine <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"167.57.13.14","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b9d9fbbbbb91937cfda6f5e277a4c97","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Haha, I wont...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m in Uruguay! Long way from the north :\/&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m contacting 2 or 3 agencies not just to find a suitable price but also to feel like I can rely on the agency in case anything happens. I had one arrange a package and they messed all up!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;How was the weather in January? I mean, we have winter down here, but we are worried about it being too windy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!!! @[member=\"calgarybride2015\"]&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894778,"PostDate":1430266643,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Haha, I wont...<\/p>\n<p>I'm in Uruguay! Long way from the north :\/\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm contacting 2 or 3 agencies not just to find a suitable price but also to feel like I can rely on the agency in case anything happens. I had one arrange a package and they messed all up!<\/p>\n<p>How was the weather in January? I mean, we have winter down here, but we are worried about it being too windy!<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!!! @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"glenrosado@gmail.com","IpAddress":"152.156.246.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423176435,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282015.jpg?_r=1428272293","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":170,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GlenRosa90","Id":282015,"Name":"GlenRosa90","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a751ece63a5ccdc15383bfad9d07f23","RawContent":"[quote name=\"GlenRosa90\" post=\"1894778\" timestamp=\"1430266643\"]\nHaha, I wont...\nI&#039;m in Uruguay! Long way from the north :\/ \nI&#039;m contacting 2 or 3 agencies not just to find a suitable price but also to feel like I can rely on the agency in case anything happens. I had one arrange a package and they messed all up!\nHow was the weather in January? I mean, we have winter down here, but we are worried about it being too windy!\nThank you!!! @[member=\"calgarybride2015\"][\/quote]Weather was beautiful. Little windy on the beach but was a god send when we were all dressed up! I think you&#039;d be happy! I don&#039;t regret it :)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1895155,"PostDate":1430539872,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>GlenRosa90, on 28 April 2015 - 04:17 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Haha, I wont...<br>\nI'm in Uruguay! Long way from the north :\/ <br>\nI'm contacting 2 or 3 agencies not just to find a suitable price but also to feel like I can rely on the agency in case anything happens. I had one arrange a package and they messed all up!<br>\nHow was the weather in January? I mean, we have winter down here, but we are worried about it being too windy!<br>\nThank you!!! @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWeather was beautiful. Little windy on the beach but was a god send when we were all dressed up! I think you'd be happy! I don't regret it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a7c62cd5a1a336e5bb02695dce72aa3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;April 30th, 2016 at the Grand Bahia Principe Coba in Riviera Maya. &amp;nbsp;Soooo excited!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Got our STD&#039;d out a few weeks ago. &amp;nbsp;Mailed our Canadian, American &amp;amp; Australian invites last weekend and sending out our UK, Ireland &amp;amp; France invites when we are in London this week!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897187,"PostDate":1432577088,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>April 30th, 2016 at the Grand Bahia Principe Coba in Riviera Maya. \u00a0Soooo excited!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Got our STD'd out a few weeks ago. \u00a0Mailed our Canadian, American & Australian invites last weekend and sending out our UK, Ireland & France invites when we are in London this week!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421442569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":78,"TotalPages":8,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":70},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
